@startuml
actor User
participant "Create Folder UI" as UI <<UI>>
participant ":FolderTestEndpoints" as FolderTestEndpoints <<Controller>>
participant ":CreateFolderCommandHandler" as CreateFolderCommandHandler <<Handler>>
participant ":ApplicationDbContext" as ApplicationDbContext <<DbContext>>
participant Database

note right of CreateFolderCommandHandler
  Managed by MediatR
end note

note right of ApplicationDbContext
  Managed by IoC
end note

User -> UI : Fill in folder name, click "Create"
activate UI
UI -> FolderTestEndpoints : POST /api/Folder
activate FolderTestEndpoints
FolderTestEndpoints -> CreateFolderCommandHandler : Handle(CreateFolderCommand)
deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
activate CreateFolderCommandHandler
CreateFolderCommandHandler -> ApplicationDbContext : Add new Folder and FolderUser
deactivate CreateFolderCommandHandler
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext -> Database : Insert Folder, FolderUser
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate Database
Database --> ApplicationDbContext : Success
deactivate Database
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext --> CreateFolderCommandHandler : Guid
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate CreateFolderCommandHandler
CreateFolderCommandHandler -> FolderTestEndpoints : Guid
deactivate CreateFolderCommandHandler
activate FolderTestEndpoints
FolderTestEndpoints --> UI : 200 OK (ApiResponse<Guid>)
deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
UI -> User : Display info: Folder created successfully
deactivate UI

@enduml